      "content": "wait but my aunt always says tea tree oil is like a natural antiseptic and it helps stuff heal way faster. if i just put a thin layer of it on, wouldnt that actually help keep the germs out better than just water?? i really dont want to go to the doctor if i can help it, it's gonna be so expensive.",
