    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what you're saying about the heat but the pain is actually unbearable right now. if i don't do something to soothe it, i feel like i'm gonna freak out. what if i just use a tiny bit of the oil just to dull the pain and protect it? surely a little bit isn't gonna cause a \"chemical burn\" or anything like that? i really need something to make it feel better right now without leaving the house.",
